description	"Dark Trooper Phase I

^2Weaponry:
- Wrist Blade
-- ^2Dual ^7/ ^5Cyan ^7Styles
-- Blaster Defense / Deflect (1)

^8Attributes:
- Life Form Scanner [Miraluka Sense 3]
- Battery Recharge (3)
- 2 Reinforcements
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Advanced Leg Hydraulics [Jump 3]
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]

Dark Troopers, the project founded by General Rom Mhoc to introduce advanced battle droids and infantry exoskeletons into the Imperial ranks. Phase I of the project introduced battle droids resembling a human skeleton, which doubles as a psychological weapon. It features advanced leg hydraulics, a wrist blade, and a shield. All of these features coupled with its tremendous size and running speed make it a truly frightening deadly weapon."